tive and motivated emergency management professional who can build relationships, manage multiple projects, communicate effectively with diverse audiences, and translate emergency management principles into practical programs and solutions. This is an opportunity to join a growing emergency management program and take an active role in advancing preparedness and resilience across the Radford University community. Read more Clinical Clearance Coordinator and Assistant to the Dean Roanoke, Virginia Administrative / Clerical Classified Staff Academic Affairs Join our team in Health and Human Services as a Clinical Clearance Coodinator and Assistant to the Dean! Read more Administrative Assistant Roanoke, Virginia Administrative / Clerical Classified Staff Academic Affairs The College of Nursing welcomes applications for the Administrative Assistant position at our Roanoke location from organized, motivated and energized individuals. Read more Housekeeping Supervisor Radford, Virginia Housekeeping Classified Staff Finance & Administration Join our team in Facilities Management! We are seeking Housekeeping Supervisor applicants for our 8am - 5pm (M-F) shift. Read more Associate Director, Student Involvement Radford, Virginia Student Affairs / Services Administrative & Professional Faculty Student Affairs Join Radford University as the Associate Director for Student Involvement and help shape the student experience through leadership development, community engagement, student media advising, and signature campus programs. This exciting leadership opportunity combines staff supervision, student organization support, and campus-wide collaboration to empower students to grow, lead, and create their own journey. Read more Assistant Coach, Women's Flag Football Club (Part-Time) Radford, Virginia Student Affairs / Services Hourly Wage/Part-Time Student Affairs The Assistant Coach for the Radford University Women's Flag Football Club Team will support all aspects of the program's operation with a primary emphasis on offensive development, recruiting, and student-athlete success. The Assistant Coach will work closely with the Head Coach to develop and implement offensive strategies, recruit prospective student-athletes, and contribute to the continued growth and competitive success of the Women's Flag Football program within Elevated Club Sports. Read more Weekend Operations Generalist Radford, Virginia Library Classified Staff Academic Affairs Do you enjoy working with college students and providing excellent customer service? Are you organized, dependable, and attentive to detail? If so, we encourage you to apply for the position of Weekend Operations Generalist at McConnell Library, part of the University Libraries at Radford University. Read more Donor-Funded Scholarship Program Manager Radford, Virginia Communications / Public Relations / Marketing Fundraising Administrative & Professional Faculty University Advancement Join our team! We’re hiring a Donor-Funded Scholarship Program Manager to connect students with scholarship opportunities and strengthen relationships with donors and campus partners. Read more Associate Director, Highlander Center for Character and Public Impact Radford, Virginia Academic Affairs Student Affairs / Services Administrative & Professional Faculty Academic Affairs Make a difference while making a living! The Radford University. Highlander Center for Character and Public Impact seeks a motivated individual to manage large projects aimed at building students' capacities to live lives of meaning and purpose through integration of character and public impact into the curriculum and outreach to community partners. This position is grant-funded through June 2028 and may be extended beyond that time frame. More information about the Highlander Center for Character and Public Impact can be found here: https://www.radford.edu/humanities-behavioral-sciences/highlander-center-for-character-public-impact/index.html Re