      "title": "Search Page",
      "description": "Search Page Home About Radford University Benefits and Wellness Applicant Login Candidate Settings Kiosk mode Skip to jobs search results Category Search categories 24 filter options found Category Academic Affairs (46 items) Administrative / Clerical (7 items) Advancement (1 items) Agriculture / Life Science (1 items) Architecture / Construction / Planning (1 items) Business / Accounting / Finance (3 items) Communications / Public Relations / Marketing (5 items) Design / Graphic Design / Industrial Design (3 items) Executive / Director / Management (4 items) Facilities / Skilled Trades (11 items) Fundraising (2 items) Housekeeping (1 items) Human Resources (3 items) Information Systems / Technology (2 items) Instructional / Teaching Faculty (35 items) Legal / Compliance (1 items) Library (1 items) Medical Professionals (11 items) Other (5 items) Performing Arts / Music / Theatre (3 items) Program/Project Management (1 items) Public Safety (3 items) Student Affairs / Services (11 items) Visual Arts / Studio Arts (3 items) Employment Type Search employment types 5 filter options found Employment Type Adjunct Faculty (37 items) Administrative & Professional Faculty (14 items) Classified Staff (32 items) Hourly Wage/Part-Time (3 items) Teaching & Research Faculty (9 items) City Search cities 3 filter options found City Other (2 items) Radford (80 items) Roanoke (12 items) Division Search 5 filter options found Division Academic Affairs (59 items) Enrollment Mgmt & Strategic Comms (3 items) Finance & Administration (23 items) Student Affairs (7 items) University Advancement (2 items) Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Jobs near me Electrician Radford, Virginia Facilities / Skilled Trades Classified Staff Finance & Administration Join our team in Facilities Management! Read more Plumber/Steamfitter Radford, Virginia Facilities / Skilled Trades Classified Staff Finance & Administration Join our Facilities Management team and help maintain the systems that keep our university running every day. You'll perform skilled installation, maintenance, repair, and troubleshooting of plumbing systems across a diverse campus, including academic buildings, residence halls, athletic facilities, and administrative spaces. Your work will directly support a safe, comfortable, and reliable environment for students, faculty, staff, and visitors. Read more Training & Technical Assistance Center Administrative Assistant Radford, Virginia Administrative / Clerical Classified Staff Academic Affairs The Virginia Department of Education's Training and Technical Assistance Center (TTAC) at Radford University (RU) is seeking a full-time Administrative & Office Specialist III. The TTAC at RU provides training and technical assistance to 33 public school divisions and state operated programs in southwest Virginia. The TTAC is grant funded on an annual basis through the Virginia Department of Education. This position, under the broad direction of the co-directors, manages the administrative and financial activities of the center. Primary responsibilities include budget and fiscal management; office management; data collection, analysis and reporting; event planning; digital resource management; and general office support. Read more Adjunct-School of Communication Radford, Virginia Academic Affairs Communications / Public Relations / Marketing Instructional / Teaching Faculty Adjunct Faculty Academic Affairs The successful applicant will become part of the School of Communication adjunct pool and may have opportunities to teach courses in the department depending on need. Read more Employee Development and Relations Specialist Radford, Virginia Human Resources Classified Staff Finance & Administration Come Join Our HR Team! Read more Vice President, Student Affairs Radford, Virginia Executive / Director / Management Student Affairs / Services Administrative & Professional Faculty Student Affairs The Vice President for Student Affairs is an innovative, caring, and student-centered executive who serves as the University’s Chief Student Affairs officer. \n\nThe executive search firm, Greenwood Asher & Associates, is assisting Radford University with this search.  Interested applicants should apply at: \nhttps://www.greenwoodsearch.com/current-opportunities/vice-president-for-student-affairs Read more Procurement Specialist, Facilities Radford, Virginia Business / Accounting / Finance Classified Staff Finance & Administration Join our Facilities Management team and play a vital role in supporting the university's mission by ensuring the timely and efficient procurement of goods and services that keep our campus operating smoothly. The Procurement Specialist manages a diverse portfolio of purchases, including construction-related materials, equipment, maintenance supplies, and contractual services, while ensuring compliance with university, state, and procurement regulations. Read more Operations Manager Radford, Virginia Other Classified Staff Academic Affairs Join our team in the Jo Ann Bingham Clinical Simulation Center (JBCSC) at Radford University. The JBCSC is a premier, multi-site healthcare simulation facility serving learners across the New River and Roanoke Valleys. As a leader in innovative, evidence-based experiential education, the CSC provides immersive, realistic clinical environments designed to prepare high-quality healthcare professionals of the future. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Counselor Education Radford, Virginia Academic Affairs Adjunct Faculty Academic Affairs Teach courses in the Counselor Education Department, including, but not limited to, Cultural & Diversity Counseling, Human Sexuality Issues in Counseling, Career Counseling & Development, Research in Counseling, Counseling Theories & Techniques. Read more Lead HVAC Technician Radford, Virginia Facilities / Skilled Trades Classified Staff Finance & Administration Join our HVAC Team at Radford University! Read more Health Educator Radford, Virginia Student Affairs / Services Administrative & Professional Faculty Student Affairs The Health Educator is charged with creating experiences with a diverse student body in mind, including all activity and ability levels. Read more Manager, Employee Relations & Compliance Radford, Virginia Human Resources Administrative & Professional Faculty Finance & Administration Looking for a new opportunity? Join the HR and Compliance Team! Read more Reporting Analyst Radford, Virginia Information Systems / Technology Classified Staff Finance & Administration Join Radford University's Data Management & Business Intelligence team! Read more Manager, Mechanical Services Radford, Virginia Facilities / Skilled Trades Classified Staff Finance & Administration Radford University is seeking a Manager, Mechanical Services to oversee the University's mechanical systems and ensure equipment operates safely and efficiently. This full-time position manages and directs the Plumbing, HVAC, and Preventative Maintenance shops. Read more Mechanical Engineer Senior/Energy Manager Radford, Virginia Facilities / Skilled Trades Classified Staff Finance & Administration Radford University is seeking a Mechanical Engineer Senior/Energy Manager to lead, manage, and optimize energy usage across our main campus. In this vital role, you will conduct energy audits, identify inefficiencies, develop and implement innovative energy-saving initiatives, and monitor usage and costs to lower overall expenditure.\n\nAdditionally, you will assist with energy contract negotiations, oversee technical mechanical trades personnel, and educate the campus community on sustainability and energy conservation best practices. Read more Adjunct Faculty--Biology Roanoke, VA Roanoke, Virginia Academic Affairs Agriculture / Life Science Instructional / Teaching Faculty Adjunct Faculty Academic Affairs Radford University’s Department of Biology is seeking motivated adjunct faculty to teach a variety of in-person courses, including courses in the Medical Laboratory Science Program, Human Anatomy & Physiology or Microbiology. In this role, you will teach the lecture, clinical simulations, or lab sections, deliver high-quality, engaging instruction, and support student success through active learning, assessment, and accessible office hours. We actively support our adjunct faculty with access to professional development opportunities through Radford’s Center for Innovative Teaching and Learning and encourage participation in departmental, college, and university-wide events. Make a meaningful impact to our students at Radford—apply today! Read more Assistant Professor - Design, Special Purpose or Tenure Track Radford, Virginia Design / Graphic Design / Industrial Design Teaching & Research Faculty Academic Affairs Join our team in Design! Read more Adjunct Faculty--Biology Radford, VA Radford, Virginia Academic Affairs Instructional / Teaching Faculty Adjunct Faculty Academic Affairs Radford University’s Department of Biology is seeking motivated adjunct faculty to teach a variety of in-person courses, including Environmental Biology, Biology for the Health Sciences, Integrative Biology, Microbiology, Human Anatomy & Physiology, or a course in your discipline. In this role, you will teach both lecture and lab sections, deliver high-quality, engaging instruction, and support student success through active learning, assessment, and accessible office hours. We actively support our adjunct faculty with access to professional development opportunities through Radford’s Center for Innovative Teaching and Learning and encourage participation in departmental, college, and university-wide events. Make a meaningful impact to our students at Radford—apply today! Read more Adjunct Faculty - Music Radford, Virginia Performing Arts / Music / Theatre Adjunct Faculty Academic Affairs Come join our team in the Department of Music! Read more Student Success Advocate Radford, Virginia Student Affairs / Services Classified Staff Student Affairs Come work for a great team that values work life balance and the ability to make a difference in the lives of our students. Read more Executive Administrative Assistant, College of Education and Human Development Radford, Virginia Academic Affairs Administrative / Clerical Classified Staff Academic Affairs Join our team as the Executive Administrative Assistant for the College of Education and Human Development and become a vital part of a college dedicated to transforming lives through education. This dynamic role offers the opportunity to support college leadership, coordinate important initiatives and events, and contribute to the success of students, faculty, and community partnerships. Read more Assistant Power Plant Superintendent Radford, Virginia Facilities / Skilled Trades Classified Staff Finance & Administration Now Hiring a qualified Assistant Superintendent of Power Plant. Read more Communication Partner Radford, Virginia Communications / Public Relations / Marketing Administrative & Professional Faculty Enrollment Mgmt & Strategic Comms Reporting to the Director of Strategic Projects and Client Support, the Communication Partner will support the communication needs of the university’s colleges and divisions. They will focus on increasing awareness and engagement of students, employees, alumni, donors and other key audiences in the events, activities and initiatives of colleges and divisions.\n\nEach partner will work directly with several deans and vice presidents (clients) to help develop communication plans and meet their communication needs, such as formal emails to employees, important college/division announcements, event coverage with content and photos, and newsletters to key stakeholder audiences. In addition, they will help develop social media strategy and assist with content planning, posting and monitoring, as appropriate.\n\nThe partners will also serve to uphold the university brand guidelines within their assigned colleges and divisions and act as liaisons to the Marketing and Communication team for larger projects that require the assistance of centralized resources.\n\nThe Communication Partner is a communication generalist who will learn to work with a variety of digital platforms (related to project management, email marketing, photo management and graphic design) to support the needs of colleges and divisions, including helping them use a portfolio of communication templates to meet their own needs.\n\nThe partners will become trusted colleagues for the deans and VPs they support, helping them tap into the resources and tools they need to achieve their communication goals. Read more Instructor, Special Purpose - Nursing Roanoke, Virginia Academic Affairs Instructional / Teaching Faculty Medical Professionals Teaching & Research Faculty Academic Affairs Find your place in the College of Nursing! Read more Assistant Professor - Nursing Radford, Virginia Academic Affairs Instructional / Teaching Faculty Medical Professionals Teaching & Research Faculty Academic Affairs Find your place in the College of Nursing! Read more Director, Greek Leadership and Campus Traditions Radford, Virginia Student Affairs / Services Administrative & Professional Faculty Student Affairs Ready to lead? Radford University is seeking applicants for the Director of a newly situated department: Greek Leadership and Campus Traditions. This position supports legacy and tradition while fostering belonging, and creativity. Join a team that is passionate about empowering curiosity to inspire purpose! Read more Professional Counselor (Part-Time) Roanoke, Virginia Student Affairs / Services Hourly Wage/Part-Time Student Affairs Radford University is currently searching for a part-time counselor at the Health Science Campus in Roanoke. Read more Talent Development Specialist Radford, Virginia Human Resources Administrative & Professional Faculty Finance & Administration Come join the HR team! Read more Adjunct Faculty - Theatre/Cinema Radford, Virginia Performing Arts / Music / Theatre Visual Arts / Studio Arts Adjunct Faculty Academic Affairs Find your place here! Read more Adjunct Faculty - Theatre Radford, Virginia Performing Arts / Music / Theatre Visual Arts / Studio Arts Adjunct Faculty Academic Affairs Join our team Read more Displaying 31 - 60 of 94 in total ‹ 1 2 3 4 › Equal Opportunity Radford University does not discriminate with regard to race, color, sex, sexual orientation, disability, age, veteran status, national origin, religion, or political affiliation in the administration of its educational programs, activities, admission or employment practices. Quick Links About Us Contact Us Privacy Policy Copyright © 2026 All Rights Reserved by Radford University . Candidate Details We use cookies. Some are necessary to operate the website and its functions. Others help personalize, improve content and services to show you the most relevant job opportunities. With the decision \"Accept essential only\" we will respect your privacy and will not set cookies that aren't necessary for the operation of the site. Accept essential only Accept all"
